{"id":"wb-6-634","name":"郏县文庙","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"郏县文庙","text":"郏县文庙位于中华人民共和国河南省平顶山市郏县南街，于金泰和六年（1206年）建为官方文庙，历史上屡遭兵燹，曾先后修建十一次。郏县文庙现存建筑22栋71间，为左学右庙建制，既是郏县的学宫，又是孔子的专祀庙宇，2006年被公布为第六批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E9%83%8F%E5%8E%BF%E6%96%87%E5%BA%99","revisionId":93684448,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=93684448","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/7abfa21f777b375f2abc717a.jpg","title":"20240710_Jiaxian_Confucian_Temple_08.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:20240710_Jiaxian_Confucian_Temple_08.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/89/20240710_Jiaxian_Confucian_Temple_08.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Windmemories","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​全国重点文物保护单位郏县文庙","width":320,"height":213}}